    "title": "MC Works 2023 Explosion 817HF Special Model",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>The MC WORKS Explosion series incorporates a medium elastic multi-ply structure enable a rod which is light, responsive and has a powerful backbone. Ideal for casting stickbaits and diving pencils, this series is designed for kingfish and tuna anglers.</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>With a higher PE rating and wide casting range, the 817HF is the perfect model for anglers seeking a powerful rod to handle monstrous kingfish and GT’s. The blank enables a comfortable yet powerful fight with an ease of manoeuvrability. The rod will swim lures accurately in addition to superior casting and control.</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Handmade in Japan</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Length: 8'1 ”</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Line: PE # 6-10</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Cast: 100-200G</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Drag max: 18KG</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Guide: Titanium Hybrid PMNSG + KWSG guide</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Code: #2304EXP817HFSP</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Colourway: Black x titanium pin stripes &amp; pewter wrapping (butt section) &amp; gunmetal</span></p>",
